OL,3,GNEWSAFord returns to outfit in World
OL,4,ARally Championship
OL,5,
OL,6,FFord has announced it will return to
OL,7,Fits headquarters in Cumbria for the
OL,8,FWorld Rally Championship as a
OL,9,Fmanufacturer in 2028.
OL,11,FAutomotive company M-Sport, based at
OL,12,FDovenby Hall near Cockermouth, ran
OL,13,FFord's World Rally Championship
OL,14,Fprogramme until 2012, before Ford
OL,15,Fwithdrew its full factory support in
OL,16,F2012.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
