OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFord returns to outfit in World
OL,4,ARally Championship
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe FIA World Rally Championship (WRC)
OL,7,Fis one of motorsport's most spectacular
OL,8,Fand demanding disciplines, taking
OL,9,Fdrivers and cars to the limit across
OL,10,Fsome of the world's most challenging
OL,11,Fterrain.
OL,13,FM-Sport founder Malcolm Wilson said
OL,14,Fwhen Ford pulled out it was "the
OL,15,Fdarkest moment in my 30 years" but the
OL,16,Fmotor giant's "vote of confidence" in
OL,17,Fthe group "showed you should never give
OL,18,Fup".
